{
  "$schema": "../gen/schemas/desktop-schema.json",
  "identifier": "main",
  "description": "Permissions for the main windows: `main` and the ones File > New Window opens (`main-<n>`), which are all the same and run plugins (listing them, and the panels for their import and export formats). Add a command here only when the UI needs it.",
